        "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued May 30 at 9:40AM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK",
        "description": "Bands of light snow will continue to move across the area through\nlate morning. Areas of locally dense fog will also remain through\naround noon or early afternoon. With temperatures hovering around\n32 to 34 degrees, any additional snow that does fall may\naccumulate on grassy surfaces, but is not expected to accumulate\non area roadways. However, snow and fog may reduce visibility to\nless than one mile at times.\n\nSlow down and use caution while traveling. For the latest road\nconditions call 5 1 1 ",
